{title: Thendral Vandhu Theendum}
{artist: Ilaiyaraaja}
{key: Am}

{c: Verse 1}
[Am] Thendral vanthu theendum,        [Asus4] pothu enna vanna [G] mo manasi [Am] la
[Am] Thingal vanthu kaayum,        [Asus4] pothu enna vanna [G] mo ninappu [Am] la
[Am] Vanthu vanthu poguthamma,        ennamellam [Em] vannamamma
[Am] Ennagalukku aethapadi,        vannamellam [Em] maarumamma
[D] Unmaiya [Dsus4] mma unmaiya,        naanum sonnen ponn [Am] amma chinna kanne
[Am] Evarum sollamale pookalum,        [Em] vaasam veesuthu
[Am] Uravum illamale iru manam,        [Em] aetho [Am] pesuthu
[Am] Evarum sollamale kuyilalellam,        [Em] thena paaduthu
[Am] Ethuvum illamale manasellam,        [Em] inippa [Am] inikkuthu
[Am] Oodai neerodai intha,        [Em] ulagam athu [C] pola
[Am] Oodam athu oodum intha,        [Em] kaalam athu [C] pola
[Am] Nilaiya nilla [Em] thu,        [D7] ninaivugalum niranga [Am] le
